somebody mentioned wanting to put the weight that your character was
carrying into the status line on the bottom.

the patch is trivial.  adding this one line puts
Wt:480/750 as weight you have and weight you can carry.

Sprintf(nb = eos(nb), "Wt:%ld/%ld",inv_weight()+weight_cap(),weight_cap());

i put it right after the time.  i don't know what's involved with adding
a showweight flag to nethackoptions, but i guess that's my next task.
(i love not having classes!)

standard disclaimer: this worked for me.  that doesn't mean it will work
for you.  actual mileage may vary; prices per person double occupancy.
this patch will void your warranty.  valid through friday only.

now, can somebody send me or post the patch for the automatic gold pickup?
my expiration date is too fast, and i missed it last time.  but i felt funny
asking for a repost without contributing /some/thing.

thanx.

